    "text": "ameliamonitor.com\nwebsite\nAmelia County, Virginia\nSchool board to recognize new student liaisons\n18 hours ago\nThe Amelia County School Board will welcome its new student liaisons for the 2025-26 school year at the board’s meeting next Monday (Sept. 15). It will hear about progress on creating the FY ’26 draft calendar and the Starbase memorandum of understanding (MOU) in addition to the usual reports.",
